        ('thiamine mononitrate', 'Thiamine Mononitrate', 'Vitamin B1 ingredient used in supplements.', 'Thiamine mononitrate is a common stable form of vitamin B1 used in supplements and fortified foods.', 'Generally low concern in standard supplement use.', 'vitamin', 'Common supplemental vitamin B1 form.', 'vitamin b1 source', 90.00, 'A', 5),
