        ('modified food starch', 'Modified Food Starch', 'Processed starch used as a filler, stabilizer, or coating aid.', 'Modified food starch is used in supplements and foods to improve texture, stability, or coating performance.', 'Generally low concern in the small amounts used as an excipient.', 'processing aid', 'Common inactive ingredient.', 'filler, stabilizer', 85.00, 'B', 5),
